      "traits": [
        "occult",
        "teleportation"
      ],
      "text": "The camarach shunts one creature within its body through an inner portal to send it away.\n\nThe target must attempt a DC 38 Will save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is teleported to an open space it chooses within 30 feet of the camarach.\n\nSuccess The creature isn't teleported.\n\nFailure The creature is teleported to a random open space 1 mile from the camarach.\n\nCritical Failure The creature is teleported to a random other plane, as Interplanar Teleport."
